{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything on it! The list can have anything on it \u2014 play it by ear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty bank vaults, sneak into government buildings, look for gang caches and don't forget the other areas. Every place is an opportunity to hit it rich here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/a01c30e84f191b90c2927971e12eaf91.poster.avif?t=1766753173\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/a01c30e84f191b90c2927971e12eaf91.webm?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/a01c30e84f191b90c2927971e12eaf91.mp4?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a pyramid of junk to climb into a hard-to-access area, or just trash everything around. Why not? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACTIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to steal access codes and carefully disarm security systems, or take a bomb on the job and show the cops a good time? Your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/eaa1cb7118a0740adae06cb55ad1be20.poster.avif?t=1766753173\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/eaa1cb7118a0740adae06cb55ad1be20.webm?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/eaa1cb7118a0740adae06cb55ad1be20.mp4?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELING UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master thief \u2014 unlock the toughest robberies and pull them off using incredible equipment. And don't forget to buy a house! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP (2-4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the merrier! Steal people blind with your buddies, or do the opposite \u2014 be a cop and stop them from taking anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/cc699f487b21b661579a9091aac04498.poster.avif?t=1766753173\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/cc699f487b21b661579a9091aac04498.webm?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/cc699f487b21b661579a9091aac04498.mp4?t=1766753173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1837730?t=1766753173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766753173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/49ad1250f762788ce4a78c1a42aa51b15a79ce69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766753173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/49ad1250f762788ce4a78c1a42aa51b15a79ce69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766753173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description"